      {
        "$id": "96",
        "$type": "FlowBlox.Core.Models.FlowBlocks.NoteFlowBlock, FlowBlox.Core",
        "Note": "Output contains one row per ticket; an empty search yields no ticket rows. Page always returns StartAt, PageSize (the server-applied page size) and Total. Advance StartAt by the number of returned ticket rows while below Total. Defaults: StartAt 0, PageSize 50. Use a stable ORDER BY in JQL for paging. Status is the actual Jira workflow label; StatusCategory is its Jira category key. Timestamps retain their Jira ISO format. Optional metadata is blank.",
